{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_lowhp": {
        "blitzcrank_attack": "【附加包】普攻造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>；大招没在冷却时，<#ffb900ff>1秒<>后再落一道闪电，造成<#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15% 法术强度<>的<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>。被动 <#e8d44dff>法力屏障<>：生命低于<#ffb900ff>30%<>时获得<#e8d44dff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% 法术强度<>的<#e8d44dff>护盾<>（冷却<#ffb900ff>60秒<>）。",
        "leblanc_attack": "【附加包】魔法飞弹。被动 <#ff9028ff>镜花水月<>：生命低于<#ffb900ff>40%<>时<#ffb900ff>隐身1秒<>并后闪，原地留下幻像（<#ffb900ff>40秒<>一次）。<#ff9028ff>幻影锁链<>：每<#ffb900ff>10秒<>对英雄的下一击改为甩出锁链，造成<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% 法强<>魔法伤害，<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>内都在附近则<#ef5350ff>禁锢1.5秒<>并再受<#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% 法强<>。",
        "lissandra_ult": "【附加包】冰封敌方英雄：<#ef5350ff>眩晕1.5秒<>，受到<#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>。生命低于<#ffb900ff>35%<>时改为冰封自己<#ffb900ff>2.5秒<>：免疫伤害和控制，回复<#7cfc00ff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>80%<>生命。冰块周围留下减速冰地。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_lowhp": {
        "blitzcrank_attack": "【附加包】普攻造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% 攻擊力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>；大絕沒在冷卻時，<#ffb900ff>1秒<>後再落一道閃電，造成<#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15% 魔法攻擊<>的<#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>。被動 <#e8d44dff>法力屏障<>：生命低於<#ffb900ff>30%<>時獲得<#e8d44dff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% 魔法攻擊<>的<#e8d44dff>護盾<>（冷卻<#ffb900ff>60秒<>）。",
        "leblanc_attack": "【附加包】魔法飛彈。被動 <#ff9028ff>鏡像<>：生命低於<#ffb900ff>40%<>時<#ffb900ff>隱形1秒<>並後閃，原地留下幻像（<#ffb900ff>40秒<>一次）。<#ff9028ff>幻影鎖鍊<>：每<#ffb900ff>10秒<>對英雄的下一擊改為甩出鎖鍊，造成<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% 法術強度<>魔法傷害，<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>內都在附近則<#ef5350ff>禁錮1.5秒<>並再受<#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% 法術強度<>。",
        "lissandra_ult": "【附加包】冰封敵方英雄：<#ef5350ff>暈眩1.5秒<>，受到<#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>。生命低於<#ffb900ff>35%<>時改為冰封自己<#ffb900ff>2.5秒<>：免疫傷害和控制，回復<#7cfc00ff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>80%<>生命。冰塊周圍留下緩速冰地。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_lowhp": {
        "blitzcrank_attack": "[Add-on] Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; while Static Field is off cooldown, lightning strikes the target <#ffb900ff>1s<> later for <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Passive <#e8d44dff>Mana Barrier<>: at <#ffb900ff>30%<> health or below he gains a <#e8d44dff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> (<#ffb900ff>60s<> cooldown).",
        "leblanc_attack": "[Add-on] Passive <#ff9028ff>Mirror Image<>: at <#ffb900ff>40%<> health or below she turns <#ffb900ff>invisible for 1s<>, slips back and leaves a clone (every <#ffb900ff>40s<>). <#ff9028ff>Ethereal Chains<>: every <#ffb900ff>10s<> her next attack on a champion is a chain: <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; held while she stays near, after <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>: <#ef5350ff>rooted 1.5s<>, <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% AP<> more.",
        "lissandra_ult": "[Add-on] Encases an enemy champion: <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>, <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. At <#ffb900ff>35%<> health or below she encases herself instead for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>: immune to damage and crowd control, healing <#7cfc00ff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>80%<>. The ice leaves a slowing field around the tomb."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_lowhp": {
        "blitzcrank_attack": "[확장] 기본 공격: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 100%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>. 정전기장이 재사용 대기 중이 아니면 <#ffb900ff>1초<> 뒤 번개가 떨어져 <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 15%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>. 기본 지속 효과 <#e8d44dff>마나 보호막<>: 체력이 <#ffb900ff>30%<> 이하가 되면 <#e8d44dff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 80%<> <#e8d44dff>보호막<>(재사용 대기 <#ffb900ff>60초<>).",
        "leblanc_attack": "[확장] 기본 지속 효과 <#ff9028ff>거울 환영<>: 체력이 <#ffb900ff>40%<> 이하가 되면 <#ffb900ff>1초<> 투명해져 물러나고 분신을 남깁니다(<#ffb900ff>40초<>). <#ff9028ff>환영 사슬<>: <#ffb900ff>10초<>마다 챔피언에 대한 다음 공격이 사슬이 되어 <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% 주문력<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>, <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> 동안 계속 가까우면 <#ef5350ff>1.5초 속박<>, <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% 주문력<> 추가 피해.",
        "lissandra_ult": "[확장] 적 챔피언을 얼려 <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> <#ef5350ff>기절<>시키고 <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>. 체력이 <#ffb900ff>35%<> 이하면 대신 자신을 <#ffb900ff>2.5초<> 얼려 피해와 군중 제어에 면역이 되고 <#7cfc00ff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>80%<>의 체력을 회복합니다. 얼음 주변에 둔화 지대가 남습니다."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_lowhp": {
        "blitzcrank_attack": "【拡張】通常攻撃は<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の100%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>。アルティメットがCD中でなければ<#ffb900ff>1秒<>後に雷が落ち<#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の15%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>。パッシブ <#e8d44dff>マナバリア<>：体力が<#ffb900ff>30%<>以下になると<#e8d44dff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の80%<>の<#e8d44dff>シールド<>（CD<#ffb900ff>60秒<>）。",
        "leblanc_attack": "【拡張】パッシブ <#ff9028ff>鏡像<>：体力が<#ffb900ff>40%<>以下になると<#ffb900ff>1秒<>インビジブルで後退し分身を残す（<#ffb900ff>40秒<>ごと）。<#ff9028ff>エーテルチェイン<>：<#ffb900ff>10秒<>ごとにチャンピオンへの次の攻撃が鎖になり<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% 魔力<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>、<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>間ずっと近ければ<#ef5350ff>1.5秒スネア<>と<#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% 魔力<>。",
        "lissandra_ult": "【拡張】敵チャンピオンを凍らせ<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<><#ef5350ff>スタン<>、<#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>。体力が<#ffb900ff>35%<>以下だと代わりに自分を<#ffb900ff>2.5秒<>凍らせ、ダメージと行動妨害を無効化し<#7cfc00ff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>80%<>回復。氷の周りにスロウの氷原が残る。"
      }
    }
  }
}
